[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m - $ 97_b = 9 \times b + 7 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m We are told that $ 17_b $ divides $ 97_b $, so in base 10:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m 
