[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the Numbers in Base $ b $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m In base $ b $, the number $ 17_b $ represents:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m 1 \cdot b + 7 = b + 7
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m Similarly, the number $ 97_b $ is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m 9 \cdot b + 7 = 9b + 7
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m We are told that $ 17_b $ divides $ 97_b $, which translates to the condition:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m \frac{9b + 7}{b + 7} \in \mathbb{Z}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=223690)[0m That is, $ b + 7 \mid 9b + 7 $.
